{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54471","headline":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 十七 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将权柄，识务辨（京本作「职务长」）春秋。\n须是先施仁与惠，後行刑戮（京本作「狱」）择其尤（辛本作「由」），威令（辛本、京本作「爱」）自然收。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54471.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54471","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}